font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; background-color: transparent; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">こんにちは。</span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px;"></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="background-color: transparent; white-space: pre-wrap;">KAPOK KNOTメルマガ編集部です！</span></span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><br></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;">この度、メルマガのタイトルを決めました！</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><strong><br></strong></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><strong>「KNOT a DAY」</strong></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><br></span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">日本語にすると、<strong>「1日を紡ぐ」</strong></span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">1日1日を丁寧に過ごしていこうという思いを込めています。</span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">また、響は「Not a day」と同じのため、サステナブルや環境保護はたった1日で実現出来るものではなく、コツコツやることに意味がある。</span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><br></span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">こんな思いを込めてタイトルを付けました。</span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="background-color: transparent; white-space: pre-wrap;"></span><br><span style="background-color: transparent; white-space: pre-wrap;">これから暑い夏がやってきますが、KAPOK KNOTは寒い冬に向けての商品づくりがまさに佳境です。そんな私たちのリアルな状況も交えながら、<strong>サステナブルな情報発信</strong>を行っていきます。</span></span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong><br></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span id="docs-internal-guid-20e46e20-7fff-b2ee-8b12-3c6c37262ef1"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong>毎週月曜日の朝7時に配信予定</strong>で、通勤や通学中に読んでいただける</span><span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">日常的にサステナブルに生活するためのヒントや、サステナビリティーについて理解を深めるために役立つ情報</span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">をお届けいたします。</span></span></span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span><span style="background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br></span></span></span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span id="docs-internal-guid-20e46e20-7fff-b2ee-8b12-3c6c37262ef1"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">毎週、少しずつ学びを増やし、皆様と一緒に「日本を代表するサステナブルブランド」へ成長していきたいと思っております！</span></span></span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><br></span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">毎週月曜朝の配信をお楽しみにいただければと思います！</span></span></p></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1629018999067" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1629018999067" data-layout-lg="4+4+4" data-extr